I must say this is a good release. It is about time a Nethack modder (other
than the SLASH'EM Dev Team) concentrate on tiles and graphics. This stubborn
habit some of these other developers (who shall remain unnamed) have about
not including a tiles version at the very least is very irrating, and frankly
they are neglecting a large portion of their potential audience. C'mon 
gentlemen, it's not 1982 anymore, we can use tiles at the very least now. 

I mean, the gameplay is much enhanced when I don't have to sit there and
puzzle out what creature is what every time or use the ";" key. I want
to give my brain a workout when I play this game, not my fingers or my
patience, sirs.

But as I said, well done, sir, well done. Please continue your work.
